Atlas is free. This license keeps it free, keeps it Porch Light's,
and keeps one front door. In plain words:

THE ONE FRONT DOOR
The only authorised sources of Atlas are the official Meet Atlas
website and the official releases it links to. If you did not get
Atlas from there, you do not have an authorised copy.

WHAT YOU MAY DO
1. Download Atlas from an official source, free of charge.
2. Use Atlas, free of charge, forever — for yourself, your
   family, your school, your work, or your organisation, on as
   many of your own machines as you like.
3. Keep a backup copy for your own use.
4. Look at how Atlas works. The code ships readable on purpose.
5. Tell people about Atlas — by linking to the official website.

WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO
1. Pass Atlas on. No giving copies to other people, no uploading
   it anywhere, no mirroring it, no bundling it with anything.
   Sharing Atlas means sharing the link, never the file.
2. Sell Atlas, rent it, or charge for access to it — in whole, in
   part, on a drive, in a bundle, or inside another product.
3. Rename it, rebrand it, remove its notices, or present it as
   your own work.
4. Distribute a modified version. If you change Atlas for your
   own use, that copy is yours to use — it may not leave your
   machines, and it may not call itself Atlas if it does.

THE NAME AND THE ORB
"Atlas", "Meet Atlas", and the Atlas orb are the names and marks
of Porch Light. This license grants no right to use them for any
other product, service, or publication. Honest description
("works with Atlas", "a guide to Atlas") is fine; implying
endorsement is not.

OTHER PEOPLE'S WORK
Atlas runs on open models and tools (including Ollama and the
models it serves). Those keep their own licenses, which this
license does not change or replace.

NO WARRANTY
Atlas is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It runs
on your machine, with your data, under your control — Porch Light
is not liable for what it does or fails to do on hardware it has
never seen. Where the law gives you rights this text cannot take
away, those rights stand.

THE SHORT VERSION
Free — from the official site, and only from the official site.
Yours to use forever. Never to pass on, sell, or rebrand.
